Content Row: items without a background of their own no longer get white text. A card with its picture above the text, or a picture card with no picture, had white text on a light block; its text now follows the block, like the block's heading. Text is white only over a picture behind it or on a dark colour of the item's own. Items without a colour in a coloured block also lose the padding and rounded corners meant for items with their own colour.
